{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1487-kelly-criterion-revisited.md", "equation": "Two-outcome bookmaker bet model: pools IN₁, IN₂ (sums of all gamblers' wagers on each side), \"fair\" parimutuel odds outₖ = αₖ·inₖ with αₖ = (IN₁+IN₂)/INₖ (pool shared among winners, no bookmaker cut, no fees/taxes). Gambler stakes fractions lₖ = inₖ/all₀ of current capital. Profit is modeled as the unique additive invariant (log of cross-ratio) of projective homographies, giving zₖ = ln(allₖ) − ln(all₀). Maximize E[z] = p₁z₁ + p₂z₂ over (l₁, l₂):", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9134}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1487-kelly-criterion-revisited.md", "equation": "E(z)(l₁,l₂) = p₁·ln(1 + (IN₂/IN₁)·l₁ − l₂) + p₂·ln(1 + (IN₁/IN₂)·l₂ − l₁). (Eq. 5)", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9134}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1487-kelly-criterion-revisited.md", "equation": "Parimutuel odds: outₖᵐ = αₖ·inₖᵐ; αₖ = (IN₁+IN₂)/INₖ ∀k. (Eqs. 2–4)", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9134}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1487-kelly-criterion-revisited.md", "equation": "Capital after outcome k: allₖ = all₀ − in₁ − in₂ + outₖ. (Eq. 4)", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9134}
