{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1487-kelly-criterion-revisited.md", "equation": "Expected log-growth: E(z)(l₁,l₂) = p₁·ln(1 + (IN₂/IN₁)l₁ − l₂) + p₂·ln(1 + (IN₁/IN₂)l₂ − l₁). (Eq. 5)", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9134}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1487-kelly-criterion-revisited.md", "equation": "Optimal-stake family (shorts allowed): (l̄₁ − p₁)·IN₂ = (l̄₂ − p₂)·IN₁. (Eq. 6)", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9134}
