{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1487-kelly-criterion-revisited.md", "equation": "Consequence: E(z) ≥ 0 always; E(z) = 0 iff p₁·IN₂ = p₂·IN₁ (pool-implied probabilities match true probabilities).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9134}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1487-kelly-criterion-revisited.md", "equation": "No-short optimum: if p₁·IN₂ > p₂·IN₁ (side 1 mispriced in gambler's favor): l₁* = p₁ − (IN₁/IN₂)·p₂, l₂* = 0. Under Laplace indifference (IN₁ = IN₂, p₁ > p₂): l₁* = p₁ − p₂, l₂* = 0.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9134}
